  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$. Priaznivých dvojíc je {@2}. $P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$. Há {@2} pares favoráveis. $P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Priaznivé: vyberieme {@3} z {@4} červených a {@5} z {@6} bielych: $\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$. $P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Favoráveis: escolhemos {@3} das {@4} vermelhas e {@5} das {@6} brancas: $\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$. $P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$.",
  "$|\\sin(-x)| = |-\\sin x| = |\\sin x|$.": "$|\\sin(-x)| = |-\\sin x| = |\\sin x|$.",
  "(na dve desatinné miesta)": "(com duas casas decimais)",
